Speaking of what, another idea comes to me... if we're going to add
steam-powered automatons to nethack, what about adding steam-powered
machines and mechanisms? I have no suitable idea for one at this
moment (a tank? a flying machine?) but I'm sure there must be
something useful.
Dwarfs would have more ability to tinker with these machines (they're
fond of such things), while elves would have less ability (more in
touch with nature and magic, I think).

Maybe such machines could be added to the '0' class of objects (iron
balls) so to not overload the tool class.

